nts-in-a-richer-view","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Navigations-and-themeable-view-a-step-further","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Components-showcases"},{"projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further#More-resources","kind":"task"}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"},"sections":[{"backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","chapter":"Go further with more ressources","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"title":"Going further with more resources","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"hero"},{"tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can get it at ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}],"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step"},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the website and learn things at "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects."}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step"},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Have a look "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to discover how OUDS works."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-3.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technical architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step"},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-4.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For technical reasons the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"design system toolbox","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step"},{"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not hesitate to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions"},{"type":"text","text":"!"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-5.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step"}],"title":"More resources","anchor":"More-resources","contentSection":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you.","type":"text"}]}],"mediaPosition":"trailing","kind":"contentAndMedia"}]}],"kind":"tasks"}],"kind":"project","metadata":{"categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"project",